url: "https://github.com/hachepunto/sjogren_MRA"
repository-code: "https://github.com/hachepunto/sjogren_MRA"
abstract: >-
  Snakemake workflow for master regulator analysis of primary Sjögren's syndrome
  in two independent whole-blood cohorts (GSE51092, GSE84844): ARACNe-AP and corto
  network inference, VIPER, Stouffer meta-analysis of regulator activity, replication
  of differential expression, functional enrichment, external validation (GSE66795,
  GSE140161) and robustness analyses (exchanged networks, CollecTRI,
  cell-composition adjustment, fgsea).
keywords:
  - Sjögren's syndrome
  - master regulator analysis
  - VIPER
  - gene regulatory network
  - interferon signature
  - transcriptomics
  - Snakemake
